{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.148, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:09.165Z", "t_ms": 7145, "delta": "While both RAGAS and ARES assess RAG systems across the same three"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.392, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:09.409Z", "t_ms": 7389, "delta": " core dimensions—context relevance, answer faithfulness, and answer relevance [C1, C7, C12]—they differ fundamentally"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.601, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:09.618Z", "t_ms": 7599, "delta": " in their evaluation methodology, model architecture, data requirements, and statistical reporting:\n\n* **Evaluation Methodology and Model Architecture:**\n  * **"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.852, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:09.869Z", "t_ms": 7850, "delta": "RAGAS** employs a reference-free prompting approach using a fixed set of heuristically hand-written prompts with a"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.03, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:10.047Z", "t_ms": 8028, "delta": " general LLM (such as `gpt-3.5-turbo-16k`) to decompose text into statements, score"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.277, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:10.294Z", "t_ms": 8275, "delta": " aspects, or evaluate relevance without training custom models [C4, C6, C13].\n  * **ARES"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.505, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:10.522Z", "t_ms": 8502, "delta": "** uses a three-stage automated training pipeline. It generates synthetic query–passage–answer triples (both positive and negative examples)"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.718, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:10.735Z", "t_ms": 8716, "delta": " from an in-domain passage corpus using an LLM (e.g., FLAN-T5 XXL) and uses them to fine"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.044, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:11.061Z", "t_ms": 9042, "delta": "-tune lightweight, dedicated judge models (such as DeBERTa-v3-Large with binary classification heads) for each of"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.14, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:11.158Z", "t_ms": 9138, "delta": " the three evaluation tasks [C1, C17, C19, C20].\n\n* **Statistical Guarantees"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.283, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:11.301Z", "t_ms": 9281, "delta": " and Output Metrics:**\n  * **RAGAS** calculates point metrics (such as customized scores and cosine similarity) without"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.468, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 38, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:11.486Z", "t_ms": 9466, "delta": " statistical confidence guarantees [C4, C12].\n  * **ARES** incorporates Prediction-Powered Inference (PPI)"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.649, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:11.667Z", "t_ms": 9647, "delta": " [C1, C4]. PPI uses predictions on a larger unlabeled dataset alongside a small annotated set to learn a rectifier function,"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.849, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 40, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:11.866Z", "t_ms": 9847, "delta": " providing statistical confidence intervals and tighter bounds for RAG performance rankings [C1, C3, C5].\n\n* **"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.057, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 41, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:12.074Z", "t_ms": 10054, "delta": "Input and Annotation Requirements:**\n  * **RAGAS** is fully reference-free and requires no human-annotated ground"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.285, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 42, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:12.303Z", "t_ms": 10283, "delta": "-truth datasets to run evaluation [C7, C8, C13].\n  * **ARES**"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.508, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 43, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:12.526Z", "t_ms": 10506, "delta": " requires three distinct inputs: an in-domain passage set, a small human-preference validation set of approximately 150 or"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.755, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 44, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:12.772Z", "t_ms": 10753, "delta": " more annotated datapoints (used for validation and PPI confidence interval estimation), and a few (e.g., five or more) few-shot"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 10.865, "data": {"request_id": "66e5bdd7a2b6", "seq": 45, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:03:12.883Z", "t_ms": 10863, "delta": " in-domain query/answer examples for synthetic data generation [C1, C6]."}}
